 white hair running straight for the town. Yua quickly chased after her, but rather than finding the rabbit-eared girl, they found something beyond their wildest imaginations...", "summary": "Come wish upon a shooting star and find \u201csomething fun and wondrous\u201d to whisk you away from boredom! Beyond rabbit girls! Beyond your wildest imagination!", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 44, "name": "Romance"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/amatarasu-riddle-star", "videos": [{"id": 141348, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "kp5_fbC4xcE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kp5_fbC4xcE", "title": "Amatarasu Riddle Star - Opening Video", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kp5_fbC4xcE/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}